# HumTrack — Revised Comprehensive Implementation Plan

**Product**: HumTrack — Scientific multi-camera marker-based motion analysis and gait analysis platform  
**Stack**: C# 12 / .NET 8 LTS / AvaloniaUI 11 / EmguCV / SkiaSharp / MathNet.Numerics  
**Classification**: CDSCO Class A / IEC 62304 Class A  
**Date**: 2026-03-09  
**Version**: 1.1

---

## Core Engineering Principles

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The following principles are non-negotiable and must be enforced at every commit.

| Principle | Implementation |
|-----------|---------------|
| **Scientific accuracy first** | Calibration and derivative computations must be numerically verifiable. No simplifications that compromise physical accuracy. |
| **Determinism** | Identical inputs must always produce byte-identical outputs. Verified by CI on every PR. |
| **Living documentation** | All docs (SRS, SDD, Traceability) are updated in the same PR as the code change that triggers them. CI blocks merges with stale docs. |
| **UI = Product** | The UI is not decoration. Every scientific operation must have a clear, premium visual workflow. Functionality and UI are designed together. |
| **Code quality** | Zero compiler warnings at all times. Full XML docstrings on all public members in `Core` and `Biomechanics`. Analysers: `Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.NetAnalyzers` + `SonarAnalyzer.CSharp`. |

---

## 1. Updated Product Vision

HumTrack provides:
- **Precision scientific measurement** from single or multi-camera video using world-calibrated coordinates
- **Auto-tracking** of 1–n markers using pluggable algorithms (Optical Flow, KCF, CSRT, Blob, Hybrid)
- **Full gait and movement analysis** pipeline with clinical-grade kinematic outputs
- **Multi-camera 3D reconstruction** for complete spatial motion capture
- **Live capture** from connected cameras with real-time marker tracking
- **Simulation-ready export** to industry formats (.c3d, OpenSim) for downstream biomechanical simulation
- An **extraordinary, memorable user interface** that makes complex scientific operations feel intuitive

