### 5.3 UI-Functionality Mapping (Critical)

| Scientific Operation | UI Expression |
|---------------------|---------------|
| Calibration not done | Amber warning strip across top of canvas: "⚠ Calibration Required — data in pixels" |
| Calibration in progress | Animated step wizard takes over full width with progress indicators |
| Calibration accepted | Subtle green checkmark on camera icon, canvas shows world grid overlay |
| Marker tracked, high confidence | Glowing cyan ring with small confidence bar arc |
| Marker tracked, low confidence | Amber ring, pulsing animation |
| Marker lost | Red 'X' at last known position, search box flashes |
| Multi-camera active | Camera count badge on the cursor canvas icon |
| Live capture active | Red REC dot in top-right corner of affected camera feeds |
| Data exported | Toast notification bottom-right, fade out in 3s |

